    "Question #: 1": {
      "Title": "Exam RE18 topic 1 question 1 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A business analyst is concerned that the project team may not have a consistent understanding of the requirements set, as project team members have been working on their own individual tasks. He wants to ensure that the whole team is on track and is willing to take the time needed to achieve this. He does not want to involve business stakeholders, nor embarrass any of the project team."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "To begin the process of improving team understanding, he wants to hold a meeting to explain and present his understanding of the requirements to the team, and to hear their thoughts and ideas about his work so far."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which of the following approaches to requirements validation will he be using?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Formal review"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Peer review"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Structured walkthrough"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Technical review"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": [
        {
          "voted_answers": "C",
