    "Question #: 4": {
      "Title": "Exam RE18 topic 1 question 4 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A business analyst is allocating elicited requirements to an appropriate category in a requirements catalogue. Here are five of the captured requirements:"
